### Crear alumno
POST http://localhost:3000/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan",
  "notas": [8, 7, 9]
}

### Crear alumno duplicado (error)
POST http://localhost:3000/alumnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Pedro",
  "notas": [8, 8, 9]
}

### Consultar todos los alumnos
GET http://localhost:3000/alumnos

### Consultar un alumno
GET http://localhost:3000/alumnos/Juan

### Modificar un alumno
PUT http://localhost:3000/alumnos/Juan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notas": [5, 6, 4]
}

### Eliminar un alumno
DELETE http://localhost:3000/alumnos/Juan
